338
00:16:30,280 --> 00:16:34,576
Actually, Mickey,
you don't have to do that. Uh...

339
00:16:35,411 --> 00:16:36,912
She's just being polite.

340
00:16:37,955 --> 00:16:41,875
She's upset with me
because I've been lying to her

341
00:16:41,959 --> 00:16:44,920
