342
00:16:45,003 --> 00:16:50,092
Really, just things that I'm super
embarrassed about or ashamed of.

343
00:16:50,676 --> 00:16:53,637
You know that movie I've been making
with Arya?

344
00:16:54,471 --> 00:16:56,181
Uh, she dropped out.

345
00:16:56,932 --> 00:17:02,646
She dropped out of the whole thing.
So now I'm just super in debt,

346
00:17:02,730 --> 00:17:05,566
and the only thing I have to show for it

347
00:17:05,649 --> 00:17:09,570
is a two-minute sizzle reel.

348
00:17:11,488 --> 00:17:14,116
-What's a sizzle reel?
-It's...

349
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:16,285
nothing.

350
00:17:17,036 --> 00:17:18,203
It's...

351
00:17:18,704 --> 00:17:20,080
it's really...

352
00:17:20,873 --> 00:17:22,750
uh, nothing.

353
00:17:23,834 --> 00:17:27,212
Look,
my point was I just blew it with Arya.

354
00:17:28,797 --> 00:17:33,552
Honestly, I think I blow every
