-Mm-hmm.

411
00:21:52,185 --> 00:21:56,690
And then we get a little doggie.

412
00:21:56,773 --> 00:22:00,819
-Oh, I like that. A beagle.
-Yeah.

413
00:22:01,570 --> 00:22:08,160
Then, we get into couples therapy.

414
00:22:08,952 --> 00:22:14,458
-Get nice and sharp and strong.
-Yeah, yeah. And then...

415
00:22:16,960 --> 00:22:23,216
